</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h2</span></span></span><span>&gt;Class 10 Maths Chapter 5: समांतर श्रेणी (Arithmetic Progression)</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h2</span></span></span><span>&gt;
