पहले पूरा ध्यान से चेक करते हैं कि <strong data-start="50" data-end="63">Meta Tags</strong> में क्या-क्या चाहिए SEO के लिए, फिर लिखते हैं।</p>
<p data-start="114" data-end="181" class="">👉 एक दम प्रो तरीके से, <strong data-start="138" data-end="163">Meta Tags में 4 चीज़ें</strong> जरूरी होती हैं:</p>
<div class="group pointer-events-none relative flex justify-center *:pointer-events-auto"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute start-full top-4 z-10 hidden h-full w-fit ps-2 md:block" data-state="closed"><button class="hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary text-token-text-secondary pointer-events-auto rounded-lg px-1 py-1 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-focus-within:opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-100"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span><div class="tableContainer horzScrollShadows relative"><table class="min-w-full" data-start="183" data-end="591"><thead data-start="183" data-end="219"><tr data-start="183" data-end="219"><th data-start="183" data-end="189" style="text-align: left;">Sr.</th><th data-start="189" data-end="200" style="text-align: left;">Meta Tag</th><th data-start="200" data-end="219" style="text-align: left;">जरूरी क्यों है?</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="237" data-end="591"><tr data-start="237" data-end="300"><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="237" data-end="241" style="text-align: left;">1</td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="241" data-end="253" style="text-align: left;"><code data-start="243" data-end="252">&lt;title&gt;</code></td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/3)]" data-start="253" data-end="300" style="text-align: left;">Google में जो Main Title दिखता है, वही है।</td></tr><tr data-start="301" data-end="390"><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="301" data-end="305" style="text-align: left;">2</td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="305" data-end="335" style="text-align: left;"><code data-start="307" data-end="334">&lt;meta name="description"&gt;</code></td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/3)]" data-start="335" data-end="390" style="text-align: left;">Search result में short explanation आता है, इसी से।</td></tr><tr data-start="391" data-end="477"><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="391" data-end="395" style="text-align: left;">3</td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="395" data-end="422" style="text-align: left;"><code data-start="397" data-end="421">&lt;meta name="keywords"&gt;</code></td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/3)]" data-start="422" data-end="477" style="text-align: left;">Old SEO के लिए था, अब कम असरदार लेकिन डाल सकते हैं।</td></tr><tr data-start="478" data-end="591"><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="478" data-end="482" style="text-align: left;">4</td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]" data-start="482" data-end="507" style="text-align: left;"><code data-start="484" data-end="506">&lt;meta name="robots"&gt;</code></td><td class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/3)]" data-start="507" data-end="591" style="text-align: left;">Page को index करना है या नहीं, ये तय करता है। (ज्यादातर index, follow रखते हैं)।</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<hr data-start="593" data-end="596" class="">
<h3 data-start="598" data-end="644" class="">✅ तो तुम्हें ये 4 Meta Tags डालने चाहिए:</h3>
<ol data-start="645" data-end="712">
<li data-start="645" data-end="659" class="">
<p data-start="648" data-end="659" class=""><strong data-start="648" data-end="657">Title</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="660" data-end="680" class="">
<p data-start="663" data-end="680" class=""><strong data-start="663" data-end="678">Description</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="681" data-end="698" class="">
<p data-start="684" data-end="698" class=""><strong data-start="684" data-end="696">Keywords</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="699" data-end="712" class="">
<p data-start="702" data-end="712" class=""><strong data-start="702" data-end="712">Robots</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="714" data-end="717" class="">
<h3 data-start="719" data-end="796" class="">अब भाई, Class 10 Maths Formulas के हिसाब से सही Meta Tags ऐसे होने चाहिए:</h3>
