<hr data-start="564" data-end="567" class="">
<h3 data-start="569" data-end="593" class="">📷 Short में समझ लो:</h3>
<ul data-start="594" data-end="754">
<li data-start="594" data-end="626" class="">
<p data-start="596" data-end="626" class=""><code data-start="596" data-end="606">og:image</code> = Image का full URL</p>
</li>
<li data-start="627" data-end="682" class="">
<p data-start="629" data-end="682" class=""><code data-start="629" data-end="644">og:image:type</code> = jpg/png जो भी तुम्हारी file type है</p>
</li>
<li data-start="683" data-end="718" class="">
<p data-start="685" data-end="718" class=""><code data-start="685" data-end="701">og:image:width</code> = ideally 1200px</p>
</li>
<li data-start="719" data-end="754" class="">
<p data-start="721" data-end="754" class=""><code data-start="721" data-end="738">og:image:height</code> = ideally 630px</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="756" data-end="846" class=""><strong data-start="756" data-end="846">(1200x630 standard size है Facebook, WhatsApp, Telegram share के लिए भी best लगता है।)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="848" data-end="851" class="">
