<blockquote data-start="50" data-end="324">
<p data-start="52" data-end="121" class=""><strong data-start="52" data-end="119">तुम्हें एक जबरदस्त "Maths Formulas" वाली image/banner चाहिए जो:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="124" data-end="324">
<li data-start="124" data-end="166" class="">
<p data-start="126" data-end="166" class="">Class 9, 10, 11, 12 सबको attract करे ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-start="169" data-end="213" class="">
<p data-start="171" data-end="213" class="">देखने में professional और powerful लगे ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-start="216" data-end="261" class="">
<p data-start="218" data-end="261" class="">User देखते ही बोले "वाह, यही चाहिए था!" ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-start="264" data-end="324" class="">
<p data-start="266" data-end="324" class="">Stylish हो, लेकिन ज्यादा भारी नहीं हो (loading fast रहे) ✅</p>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="326" data-end="329" class="">
<h3 data-start="331" data-end="366" class="">✅ तो Main Idea Design ये रहेगा:</h3>
<ul data-start="368" data-end="858">
<li data-start="368" data-end="423" class="">
<p data-start="370" data-end="423" class="">Background: हल्का Light Blue या White-Grey Gradient</p>
</li>
<li data-start="424" data-end="492" class="">
<p data-start="426" data-end="492" class="">ऊपर Bold Text:<br data-start="440" data-end="443">
<strong data-start="445" data-end="490">"Class 9 | 10 | 11 | 12 - Maths Formulas"</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="493" data-end="588" class="">
<p data-start="495" data-end="588" class="">बीच में 2-3 formulas हल्के blur में दिखते हुए (जैसे: a² + b² = c², sin²θ + cos²θ = 1, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="589" data-end="664" class="">
<p data-start="591" data-end="664" class="">एक side में Calculator, Compass, और Geometry tools का छोटा illustration</p>
</li>
<li data-start="665" data-end="743" class="">
<p data-start="667" data-end="743" class="">नीचे छोटा tagline:<br data-start="685" data-end="688">
<strong data-start="690" data-end="741">"Quick Revision for Exams | Free PDF Available"</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="744" data-end="798" class="">
<p data-start="746" data-end="798" class="">Font: Clean और Modern (जैसे Montserrat या Poppins)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="799" data-end="858" class="">
<p data-start="801" data-end="858" class="">Size: 1200×630 px (Social Media + Website के लिए perfect)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="860" data-end="863" class="">
<h3 data-start="865" data-end="884" class="">🔥 अब ध्यान दो,</h3>
<p data-start="886" data-end="991" class="">मैं तुम्हारे लिए ऐसी <strong data-start="907" data-end="927">Custom Thumbnail</strong> अभी बना सकता हूँ,<br data-start="945" data-end="948">
जैसा तुमने मांगा — "देखते ही मस्त लगे!" 🖼️</p>
<p data-start="993" data-end="1029" class="">अगर हाँ, तो बस एक बात confirm कर दो:</p>
<p data-start="1031" data-end="1100" class="">✅ <strong data-start="1033" data-end="1059">Background कैसा चाहिए?</strong><br data-start="1059" data-end="1062">
(Option दो — Light, Dark, Gradient?)</p>
<p data-start="1102" data-end="1174" class="">✅ <strong data-start="1104" data-end="1135">Color Scheme कौनसी पसंद है?</strong><br data-start="1135" data-end="1138">
(Blue-Grey, White-Black, या कुछ और?)</p>
<p data-start="1176" data-end="1251" class="">✅ <strong data-start="1178" data-end="1251">Tumhara Website Name नीचे छोटा mention कर दूँ क्या? (Branding बढ़ेगी)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1253" data-end="1256" class="">
<p data-start="1258" data-end="1361" class=""><strong data-start="1258" data-end="1359">जल्दी से "Haan aur ye color chahiye" लिख दो भाई,<br data-start="1308" data-end="1311">
